{"id":"2e6c7ec5afeb5526","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-requirement-satisfaction.md","title":"Requirement Satisfaction","display":"df-requirement-satisfaction — Requirement Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-requirement-satisfaction","aliases":["68-df-requirement-satisfaction"],"display":"df-requirement-satisfaction — Requirement Satisfaction","depends_on":[],"source_location":"not located in supplied Shoenfield PDF; local framework","verification_status":"local-framework-definition","source_proof_status":"not-a-book-theorem","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-requirement-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-requirement-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-requirement-satisfaction — Requirement Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"not located in supplied Shoenfield PDF; local framework"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-framework-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-a-book-theorem"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\)</span> 为一个要求的外延，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in X\">\\(w\\in X\\)</span> 为同一论域中的候选对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}\\)</span> 为以下定义的三参数谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}(X,R,w)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;R\\subseteq X\\land w\\in R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}(X,R,w)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;R\\subseteq X\\land w\\in R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是本地集合论接口，不是原书新增定理。对最终集合用 X=P(N)，对无穷路径用相应路径空间，对阶段编号可另取 X=N；同一 R 的论域固定后不能在不同对象之间混用。原来 Sat(R,w)↔R(w) 未声明 R 的类型，且调用点把阶段、有限近似与真路径互换；此修订显式绑定论域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}(X,R,w)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;R\\subseteq X\\land w\\in R.","display":true}],"bytes":1128,"backlinks":[{"id":"caaaa328dfa0f547","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$，$\\vec f=(f_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}^{\\mathbb N}$，$f\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}$，$R\\in\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N})^T$。$\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$、$\\sqsubseteq$、有限序列长度见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]；$\\mathrm{Sat}$ 见 [[68-df-requirement-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-requirement-satisfaction|df-requirement-satisfaction — Requirement Satisfaction]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-requirement-satisfaction]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-requirement-satisfaction|df-requirement-satisfaction — Requirement Satisfaction]]"}],"outgoing":[]}